Package: soundcloud-cardputer
Version: 1.0.2
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Egor <egorkhlud9-cell@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pygame, mpv, yt-dlp
Description: Native SoundCloud player for Cardputer Zero
 Native Pygame/SDL2 interface with MPV playback, public SoundCloud search,
 local favorites, playlists and playback history. No API keys or subscription required.
